{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sled Together is a fast-paced arcade race with unique penguin launch mechanics. Compete on a series of colorful tracks: maneuver between traps, outrun rivals and collect boosts that help you or hinder others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main feature of the game is the moment when you release your penguin into free flight. Calculate the speed, angle and trajectory to hit the target accurately and earn maximum points. The more accurate the hit, the higher the result.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track has its own tactics waiting for you: combine the drive of the race with the skill of launching to leave your rivals behind. At the end of the race, the points are counted, and the winner is the one who combines the speed, accuracy and aerodynamics of the penguin the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/dbaee7e5a22b04e0338eb261d15e4e21.poster.avif?t=1759604787\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/dbaee7e5a22b04e0338eb261d15e4e21.webm?t=1759604787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/dbaee7e5a22b04e0338eb261d15e4e21.mp4?t=1759604787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique ice tracks with traps, obstacles and targets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crazy mix of racing and launching a penguin into flight \u2014 speed + precision = victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boosts that help you or hinder your rivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization of penguins: hats, scarves, new characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_para